From 04ae29d13eb6336529cae44a18ed8544d75395c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:43:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Updater: use ExpressiveOS's logo as the app icon

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: the app icon was Evolution X's E on a blue
disc. Show the ExpressiveOS logo on black instead, and add a monochrome
layer with the mark's four petals so themed icons work too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
